{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1489534-gather-an-army-of-rage-random-garou-generator","id":1489534,"title":"Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou generator.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-08T23:26:13-07:00","id":1489534,"title":"Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou generator.","content":"Ever want to create a Garou but too lazy to gather your pen and paper and crack open books? Or perhaps you need one of Gaia's Warriors right now and don't have time to fiddle with numbers and choices.<br /> Well, now you can make a random Garou in mere seconds using this <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">'Alpha' release google spreadsheet</a>.<br /> <br /> Completely done in sheet formulae, no scripts to worry about. Runs in your browser.<br /> <br /> With thanks to SpreadsheetGarou.<br /> <br /> Please note: all &quot;characters&quot; still require a player to bring them to life with a backstory. RNG and I could only do so much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Also note: No Freebies or XP are tracked or spent. Nor is Renown. The assumption is that if you're making a starting character (which ought to be legal per char gen!) you still have Freebie points to spend, and if you're making a non-starting character then all Freebie and Experience points have been allocated to give you the result on the page. Some Garou have far more XP than others. Such is Gaia's will.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T00:23:37-07:00","id":1489611,"title":"","content":"There are some hiccups like giving homid BSD homid gifts and wrong breed gifts. But otherwise REALLY good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-11T05:07:10-07:00","id":1489733,"title":"","content":"hm, wrong breed gifts? Technically not possible assuming the input data is correct. Hm.<br /> <br /> I *suspect* what happens in that situation is that the page hasn't refreshed after the final iteration. The way the sheet works it needs to run through the calculations twice. So on the first roll of the dice (so to speak) you get Fianna, then the sheet rerolls and selects Red Talons. However the forward facing sheet you see doesn't update the chosen gifts, so you end up with a Red Talon using Fianna gifts.<br /> <br /> *suspect*<br /> <br /> Fiendishly hard to prove, and I'm not sure I can force the facing sheet to refresh. If you happen to notice it again, I would appreciate it if you could let me know the displayed Tribe/Auspice/Breed vs the chosen gifts Tribe/Auspice/Breed. Just in case i can identify a problem with those specifically. It's always possible I got the data wrong somehow too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The BSD homid Gifts are definitely in the normal homid list. I considered not including them, but figured they are technically acquirable by all Garou Homids. I should change the ratios to make them a lot rarer for non BSDs though.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your feedback! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T04:47:49-07:00","id":1490013,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, I've fiddled with the formulae so that now the Gift list appears next to each Gift name. So that should help identify which of my theories is correct - is it the page sync or a data error.<br /> So far in my testing it hasn't shown an out of sync mismatch.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T14:00:39-07:00","id":1490059,"title":"","content":"Edit: Screenshots did not load.<br /> <br /> Here are two bugs I noticed by just using the generator today;<br /> <br /> Gifts were listed as N/A<br /> <br /> A Stargazer had the Fenrir gift Snow Running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","user":"Ana Mizuki","date":". 08-13-2022, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T22:34:21-07:00","id":1490098,"title":"","content":"hm. Bummer about the screenshots, and even more bummer about the errors.I hate errors I can't replicate!<br /> Thanks for the information. I'll keep looking. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-15T01:19:40-07:00","id":1490229,"title":"","content":"It's actually really nice, my only bother is with the attributes, there can be a lot of 1. An option to have no 1 in attributes would be amazing (at least for me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).<br /> <br /> I want to add that this is already amazing for it can be so useful as a DM","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8944-tanakyelle","name":"Tanakyelle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8944_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-15T02:05:37-07:00","id":1490232,"title":"","content":"Here are some screenshots;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aQJD9Wb.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Bleed is a BSD metis gift: <a href=\"https://www.wyrmfoe.com/2714/bleed/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wyrmfoe.com/2714/bleed/</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PPjcGzW.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Aura of Poison is a BSD homid gift: <a href=\"https://www.wyrmfoe.com/2705/aura-of-poison/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wyrmfoe.com/2705/aura-of-poison/</a><br /> <br /> The Aura of Poison gift got 'stuck' and stayed with the next two generations;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/bAUl0Lq.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/bAUl0Lq.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/bAUl0Lq.png\" target=\"_blank\"> https://i.imgur.com/bAUl0Lq.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UUM7tR.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UUM7tR.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UUM7tR.png\" target=\"_blank\"> https://i.imgur.com/4UUM7tR.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T04:36:41-07:00","id":1490506,"title":"","content":"Thanks for that report!<br /> <br /> Do you have a page ref for restricting the BSD Homid Gifts to only BSD Homids? My understanding is, that even though no &quot;sane&quot; Garou would want to track down the Bane to learn the Gift, they could. Thus it remains an option for all Homids. That said, I have drastically reduced it's occurrence so you shouldn't see it anywhere near as often.<br /> <br /> And in doing that I was able to - perhaps - replicate the other issues you've screenshotted! That was a win! My hypothesis is that one (or a few) of the formulae in the sheet trigger a refresh of the sheet. In particular the initial Gift selection queries. This leads to a potential cascade until &lt;whatever triggers the refresh&gt; doesn't change, and thus the sheet can settle on a result. But what I've managed to capture is a situation where the google sheet simply stops executing, leaving cells showing completely different data than the cells their referencing.<br /> <br /> I assume this is related to the built in iteration limits. It might also be dependent on local browser resources, which could explain why it's so hard for me to replicate something you found immediately since I have a fairly beefy system? I dunno...<br /> <br /> With that guess/hypothesis in mind, I'll have to rethink how the sheet does some calculations to hopefully remove (or at least minimize) the recalculation triggers. This'll be tricky cuz the queries seemed to be ideal. Ah well, live 'n' learn. Worst case is, I'm wrong and i rejigger the sheet for no gain.<br /> <br /> Thanks again. I'll post here again when i have (maybe) fixed the issues. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T04:35:16-07:00","id":1491743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nikink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1489534-gather-an-army-of-rage-random-garou-generator#post1489534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ever want to create a Garou but too lazy to gather your pen and paper and crack open books? Or perhaps you need one of Gaia's Warriors right now and don't have time to fiddle with numbers and choices.<br /> Well, now you can make a random Garou in mere seconds using this <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;]'Alpha</a>' release google spreadsheet[/URL].<br /> <br /> Completely done in sheet formulae, no scripts to worry about. Runs in your browser.<br /> <br /> With thanks to SpreadsheetGarou.<br /> <br /> Please note: all &amp;quot;characters&amp;quot; still require a player to bring them to life with a backstory. RNG and I could only do so much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Also note: No Freebies or XP are tracked or spent. Nor is Renown. The assumption is that if you're making a starting character (which ought to be legal per char gen!) you still have Freebie points to spend, and if you're making a non-starting character then all Freebie and Experience points have been allocated to give you the result on the page. Some Garou have far more XP than others. Such is Gaia's will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Get on Fenrice Crinps-born Galliard. Once I loved them... and now they are were-Nazi. Great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4950-lashet","name":"Lashet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"281"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T10:17:30-07:00","id":1491920,"t